WEBVTT

00:01:57.879 --> 00:02:02.001
So’ng agar yangi dori platseboga nisbatan
sezilarli darajada foyda bersa,

00:02:02.001 --> 00:02:03.998
uning samarasi sinovdan o'tgan.

00:02:03.998 --> 00:02:09.501
Hozirda platsebodan bu yo'lda foydalanish
axloqiy masalalar bois odat tusida emas.

00:02:09.501 --> 00:02:13.038
Agar eskiroq versiyadagi dorini 
yangisiga yoki boshqa bir doriga

00:02:13.038 --> 00:02:14.908
solishtirish imkoni bo’lganda edi,

00:02:14.908 --> 00:02:18.645
bu insonga hech qanaqangi dori 
bermagan yaxshiroq,

00:02:18.645 --> 00:02:21.190
ayniqsa, ular jiddiy xastalikka 
chalingan bo’lsa.

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:26.243
Bu holatlarda platsebolardan odatda 
yangi, eski va alternativ dorilarning

00:02:26.243 --> 00:02:29.811
xususiyatlarni aniqroq 
solishtirishda sinovning haqqoniyligini

00:02:29.811 --> 00:02:33.096
ta’minlash maqsadida foydalaniladi.